---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  seoTitle="Disclaimer: Accuracy and Limits of Our Content"
  subtitle="Please read before relying on information from this site"
  description={`Important information about the accuracy, independence and limits of content on ${SITE.name}. Always confirm dates and details on the official website before acting.`}
  updated="3 October 2026"
>
  <div class="notice">
    <strong>In short:</strong> we check our facts against official sources, but things change. Always confirm
    dates, eligibility and fees on the official website before you apply or pay anything.
  </div>

  <h2>1. General information only</h2>
  <p>
    All content on {SITE.name} is published in good faith for general information. While we take facts from
    official sources and review every post, we make no warranty about the completeness, reliability or accuracy of
    this information. Any action you take based on information on this Site is strictly at your own risk.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Dates, eligibility and fees can change</h2>
  <p>
    Recruitment bodies, exam authorities, government departments and organisers can change deadlines, eligibility
    criteria, fees, vacancies, benefit amounts, installment dates and selection processes at any time, sometimes without notice. We update posts when we learn
    of changes, but there may be a delay. The official notification or organiser's page is always the final
    authority.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Not an official website</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is an independent website. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or acting on behalf of any
    government ministry or department, public sector undertaking, recruitment board, exam conducting body (such as
    UPSC, SSC, RRBs or the IITs conducting GATE), university, or any company mentioned on the
    Site. Names, logos and trademarks belong to their respective owners and are used only to identify the
    organisations we write about.
  </p>

  <h2>4. We don't process applications</h2>
  <p>
    We don't accept applications, collect fees, issue admit cards or declare results. We never ask for payments,
    OTPs or passwords. Apply only through the official links we provide.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Career and earning content</h2>
  <p>
    Posts about side income, freelancing and careers share general ideas, realistic ranges and our
    opinion. They are not financial, legal or professional advice, and we don't guarantee any income, selection or
    result. Outcomes depend on your skills, effort, location and circumstances.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Opinions</h2>
  <p>
    Sections such as "Should you apply?" or "Our take" reflect our honest view at the time of writing. Others may
    reasonably disagree.
  </p>

  <h2>7. External links</h2>
  <p>
    The Site links to external websites that we don't control. A link is not an endorsement, and we aren't
    responsible for the content, availability or privacy practices of those sites.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Advertising and affiliate disclosure</h2>
  <p>
    The Site may display ads, including through Google AdSense. Ads are served automatically and don't mean we
    endorse the product or service. We don't currently use affiliate links. If we do in future, or publish
    sponsored content, it will be clearly labelled.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Errors and contact</h2>
  <p>
    If you find an error, please email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> with the post link and the
    official source, and we'll correct it.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
